                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Control/Valve.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 19,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "I don't know what this means.  Can you help me out with an example?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Control/Valve.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 19,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "The control interface will reside at the path mentioned here, just like the FanPWM control which resides on its own path, for example, below -\n\n```\nroot@rmc023-oob:~# busctl tree xyz.openbmc_project.FanSensor\n\u2514\u2500 /xyz\n  \u2514\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project\n    \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/control\n    \u2502 \u2514\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/control/fanpwm\n    \u2502   \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/control/fanpwm/FCB_0_FAN0_PWM_PCT\n    \u2502   \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/control/fanpwm/FCB_0_FAN1_PWM_PCT\n    \u2502   \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/control/fanpwm/FCB_1_FAN2_PWM_PCT\n    \u2502   \u2514\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/control/fanpwm/FCB_1_FAN3_PWM_PCT\n    \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory\n    \u2514\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors\n      \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/fan_pwm\n      \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/fan_pwm/FCB_0_FAN0_PWM_PCT\n      \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/fan_pwm/FCB_0_FAN1_PWM_PCT\n      \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/fan_pwm/FCB_1_FAN2_PWM_PCT\n      \u2502 \u2514\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/fan_pwm/FCB_1_FAN3_PWM_PCT\n      \u2514\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/fan_tach\n        \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/fan_tach/FCB_0_FAN0_TACH_IL_SPEED_RPM\n        \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/fan_tach/FCB_0_FAN0_TACH_OL_SPEED_RPM\n...\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Control/Valve.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 19,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "So isn't the namespace `/xyz/openbmc_project/control/valve` ?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Control/Valve.interface.yaml",
